   "MapMaker"
  ],
  "accessInformation": "Ordinances of secession and acts of admission (states); Natural Earth (outlines); National Park Service, American Battlefield Protection Program (battlefields); Jeremy Atack (railroads); Esri.",
  "licenseInfo": "Facts from public records; state outlines from Natural Earth (public domain); battlefield areas from the National Park Service; railroads from Jeremy Atack's database, used with its citation. Text written for this map is original.",
